    "readme_description": "An array is considered **special** if the **parity** of every pair of adjacent elements is different. In other words, one element in each pair **must** be even, and the other **must** be odd.\n\nYou are given an array of integers `nums`. Return `true` if `nums` is a **special** array, otherwise, return `false`.",
